---
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Privacy Policy | einvoiceops</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Privacy policy for einvoiceops. How personal data from email enquiries is handled under GDPR." />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --navy:   #1a2b3c;
      --accent: #2563eb;
      --text:   #111827;
      --sub:    #374151;
      --muted:  #6b7280;
      --border: #e5e7eb;
      --bg:     #ffffff;
      --sans:   -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      font-family: var(--sans);
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--bg);
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 16px;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 56px 2rem 80px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.07em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 36px 0 10px;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--sub);
      line-height: 1.75;
    }
    p + p { margin-top: 10px; }
    ul {
      margin: 10px 0 10px 1.4rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--sub);
      line-height: 1.75;
    }
    li { margin-bottom: 4px; }
    a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .highlight-box {
      background: #f0fdf4;
      border: 1px solid #a7f3d0;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: #065f46;
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
    footer {
      padding: 28px 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    footer p { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); }
    footer a { color: var(--accent); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <Nav />

  <main>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Last updated: 2 May 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Data Controller</h2>
    <p>
      Jens Anttila (einvoiceops Oy, in formation)<br />
      Finland<br />
      Email: <a href="mailto:jens@einvoiceops.eu">jens@einvoiceops.eu</a>
    </p>

    <h2>2. What This Site Collects</h2>
    <p>
      This website uses no cookies, analytics scripts, tracking pixels, or third-party services.
      No personal data is collected or stored by visiting or browsing the site.
    </p>
    <p>
      Personal data is processed only when you contact us by email. The data processed is:
      your name, email address, company name, and the content of your message.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Purpose of Processing</h2>
    <p>
      To respond to your business enquiry and, if relevant, to provide the service you requested.
      Your data is not used for any other purpose, including marketing.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Legal Basis</h2>
    <p>
      Processing is based on legitimate interests (GDPR Art.&nbsp;6(1)(f)): responding to
      inbound business enquiries is a legitimate interest of the operator. Where an enquiry
      progresses to a potential engagement, processing is also based on pre-contractual steps
      at your request (Art.&nbsp;6(1)(b)).
    </p>

    <h2>5. Retention</h2>
    <p>
      Email enquiries are retained for up to 2 years from the date of last contact, unless a
      contract is established. Where a contract is signed, relevant correspondence is retained
      for the duration of the contract plus any legally required accounting retention period
      (6 years under Finnish Accounting Act 1336/1997).
    </p>

    <h2>6. Recipients and Sub-processors</h2>
    <p>
      Your data is not shared with third parties, sold, or used for advertising or profiling.
    </p>
    <p>
      This website is hosted on GitHub Pages (GitHub, Inc., a Microsoft subsidiary). GitHub
      processes web server logs (including IP addresses) as part of standard hosting operations.
      GitHub's privacy statement is available at github.com/site/privacy. Email enquiries are
      handled via Google Workspace (Google LLC) and stored on Google's EU infrastructure.
      No personal data is transferred outside the European Economic Area.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>Under GDPR (EU 2016/679), you have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Access the personal data we hold about you</li>
      <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
      <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
      <li>Object to or request restriction of processing</li>
      <li>Receive your data in a portable format</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      To exercise any of these rights, email <a href="mailto:jens@einvoiceops.eu">jens@einvoiceops.eu</a>.
      We will respond within 30 days.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you are not satisfied with our handling of a request, you may lodge a complaint with the
      Finnish Data Protection Ombudsman (<em>Tietosuojavaltuutettu</em>):
      <a href="https://tietosuoja.fi" target="_blank" rel="noopener">tietosuoja.fi</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
    <p>
      This site sets no cookies and runs no analytics or third-party scripts. No cookie consent
      banner is displayed because none is required.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      If this policy changes materially, the "Last updated" date above will be revised.
      Given the minimal scope of data processing, significant changes are unlikely.
    </p>

    <div class="highlight-box">
      Short version: we only receive your data if you email us, we use it to reply,
      we do not share it, and you can ask us to delete it at any time.
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>einvoiceops &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <a href="mailto:jens@einvoiceops.eu">jens@einvoiceops.eu</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Finland</p>
    <p>&copy; 2026 einvoiceops &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <a href="/legal/">Legal Notice</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a></p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
